# A branded install URL. The README already tells people to pipe the raw GitHub
# script into a shell; this makes the documented command
#
#   curl -fsSL https://mtty.dev/miao/install | bash
#
# so it survives the installer moving. Cloudflare does not normalise the path,
# hence both spellings. Parsed by Workers, not served as an asset.
/miao/install   https://raw.githubusercontent.com/oxdingzg/miao/main/install   302
/miao/install/  https://raw.githubusercontent.com/oxdingzg/miao/main/install   302

